Authors and copyright holders of code bundled with or ported into selectrs
===========================================================================

R code and tests
----------------

The R sources (R/) and the test suites (tests/testthat/) are ports of the
'selectr' package by Simon Potter (https://github.com/sjp/selectr,
BSD 3-clause; pinned at commit 9ed9bb2 as the port oracle). selectr is
itself a translation of the Python package 'cssselect'
(https://github.com/scrapy/cssselect, BSD 3-clause) by Ian Bicking,
Simon Sapin, and contributors, originally part of lxml.cssselect.
Copyright holders of the ported code: Simon Potter, Simon Sapin,
Ian Bicking.

